WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.243
What if you feel uneasy and want to slow down, or pause completely?

2
00:00:00.243 --> 00:00:00.402
You are always in charge of the brake pedal.

3
00:00:00.402 --> 00:00:00.713
Drag your safety dial down or press Freeze anytime you want extra calm—it takes effect

4
00:00:00.713 --> 00:00:00.851
immediately without asking permission.
